  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help children off the streets into school</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Rwanda, since 2012 Root Foundation is working on saving children from a life on the street by taking them through personal development programs, and sponsoring education as one way to create hope and a future for them. Over 1,500 children have engaged in our programs, but with limited resources we&apos;ve been able to sponsor about 15%. For a donation of $30 and more you can support a child through a term and for $100 a child can study for a full academic year with all required materials</narrative>
  </description>
